flowchart TD
    Start([👤 User Message]) --> Handler[📨 chatHandler]
    Handler --> Save[💾 Save user message]
    Save --> Agent[🤖 processAgenticRequest]

    Agent --> Pure{⚡ Pure action<br/>phrasing?}
    Pure -->|no| RAG[🔍 RAG retrieveContext<br/>60s cache]
    Pure -->|yes| Loop
    RAG --> Cite[📎 Collect citations<br/>similarity greater than 0.7]
    Cite --> Loop[🔁 ReAct Loop<br/>max 8 iterations]

    Loop --> Stream[🌐 streamGeminiWithTools<br/>SSE]
    Stream --> Calls{🛠️ Function<br/>calls?}

    Calls -->|none| Final[✅ Final answer text]
    Calls -->|yes| Think[🧠 Record thinking step]
    Think --> Exec[⚙️ executeTool per call]

    Exec --> ToolRoute{📌 Tool name}
    ToolRoute -->|search_knowledge_base| KB[(🗃️ knowledge_chunks<br/>pgvector)]
    ToolRoute -->|list_items / get_agenda / find_free_slots| Read[(📖 tasks / notes / events)]
    ToolRoute -->|create_* / update_* / schedule_*| Write[(✏️ tasks / notes / events)]
    ToolRoute -->|delete_item| Pending[⏸️ Pending confirmation<br/>no deletion yet]

    KB --> Append[➕ Append tool result<br/>to conversation]
    Read --> Append
    Write --> Clear[🧹 Invalidate RAG cache]
    Clear --> Append
    Pending --> Append

    Append --> Loop

    Loop -->|iterations exhausted| Limit[⚠️ Step-limit response]

    Final --> Response[💬 Agent response:<br/>message, sources, tools, steps]
    Limit --> Response

    Agent -->|🔴 unhandled exception| Fallback[🔄 Fallback: callOpenRouterAPI]
    Fallback --> FallbackResponse[💬 Plain-text response<br/>no tools, no citations]

    Response --> Persist[💾 Save AI message + metadata]
    FallbackResponse --> Persist
    Persist --> End([✅ Rendered in Chat UI])

    %% Styling
    classDef success fill:#90EE90,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px,color:darkgreen
    classDef error fill:#FFB6C1,stroke:#DC143C,stroke-width:2px,color:black
    classDef api fill:#87CEEB,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px,color:darkblue
    classDef store fill:#E6E6FA,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px,color:darkblue

    class Stream,Fallback api
    class Final,Response,End success
    class Limit,FallbackResponse error
    class KB,Read,Write store
